<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S4.SS6" title="In 4 Results ‣ Can Small Language Models Use What They Retrieve?An Empirical Study of Retrieval Utilization Across Model Scale" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">4.6 </span>Prompt Robustness</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S4.SS7" title="In 4 Results ‣ Can Small Language Models Use What They Retrieve?An Empirical Study of Retrieval Utilization Across Model Scale" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">4.7 </span>Cross-Architecture Validation</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S5" title="In Can Small Language Models Use What They Retrieve?An Empirical Study of Retrieval Utilization Across Model Scale" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">5 </span>Error Analysis</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_section">
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S5.SS0.SSS0.Px1" title="In 5 Error Analysis ‣ Can Small Language Models Use What They Retrieve?An Empirical Study of Retrieval Utilization Across Model Scale" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Irrelevant generation</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S5.SS0.SSS0.Px2" title="In 5 Error Analysis ‣ Can Small Language Models Use What They Retrieve?An Empirical Study of Retrieval Utilization Across Model Scale" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Refusal</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S5.SS0.SSS0.Px3" title="In 5 Error Analysis ‣ Can Small Language Models Use What They Retrieve?An Empirical Study of Retrieval Utilization Across Model Scale" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Format-related failures</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S6" title="In Can Small Language Models Use What They Retrieve?An Empirical Study of Retrieval Utilization Across Model Scale" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">6 </span>Discussion</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_section">
