<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S6.SS2" title="In 6 Discussion ‣ Can Small Language Models Use What They Retrieve?An Empirical Study of Retrieval Utilization Across Model Scale" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">6.2 </span>Why Does Context Hurt Known Answers?</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S6.SS3" title="In 6 Discussion ‣ Can Small Language Models Use What They Retrieve?An Empirical Study of Retrieval Utilization Across Model Scale" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">6.3 </span>Implications for Practitioners</span></a></li>
