<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#Sx1.SS0.SSS0.Px3" title="In Limitations ‣ Can Small Language Models Use What They Retrieve?An Empirical Study of Retrieval Utilization Across Model Scale" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Quantization.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#Sx1.SS0.SSS0.Px4" title="In Limitations ‣ Can Small Language Models Use What They Retrieve?An Empirical Study of Retrieval Utilization Across Model Scale" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Corpus coverage and oracle quality.</span></a></li>
